{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>女西醫蔡淑梅涉嫌濫發逾萬張「免針紙」，案件今日宣判。</p><p></p><p>蔡淑梅早上抵達區域法院聽取判決。</p><p></p><p>案情指，被告在元朗開診所在不具精神科或心理學專業資格下，涉嫌2022年在8個月內濫發約1.2萬張「免針紙」，多以疫苗恐懼症為理由，被控17項不誠實地取用電腦罪。她同丈夫同時被控7項洗黑錢罪，涉款逾760萬元。兩人否認全部控罪。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T03:11:11.614682+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":157,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T02:11:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T03:24:52.789753+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T03:04:37.879641+00:00","content_hash":"5761df74c01c0476e553bba4827ac9a9ff5f0e722e85e2ddd2d06de31df62240","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T03:11:11.614682+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}